message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "PMSP learnheuristics: code, data and analysis for 'Mechanism or policy? Budget-fair attribution of the gains of learning-guided metaheuristics in scheduling'"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Araújo"
    given-names: "Carlos Vinicio Dantas"
    email: "carlos.vinicio@aluno.uece.br"
