repository-code: "https://github.com/CarlosAraujo7/pmsp"
keywords:
  - parallel machine scheduling
  - makespan
  - iterated greedy
  - Q-learning
  - adaptive operator selection
  - learnheuristics
abstract: >-
  Source code, pre-specified experiment scripts (with md5 hashes of the frozen
  versions), result files and LaTeX sources supporting a study that decomposes the
  gains of Q-Learning-guided metaheuristics for P||Cmax into the contribution of
  the search mechanism and of the learned selection policy.
